<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs unevenly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs unevenly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were unevenly steady. Demand was light to moderate with a moderate movement. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  50.50-52.00 Few 50.00 &amp; 52.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  44.00-50.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  39.00-44.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/firm. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00 Few 39.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 45.00-48.00 Few 48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
